<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal PSBR drops to 538.2 bln esc Jan-Sept.</title>
<headline>Portugal PSBR drops to 538.2 bln esc Jan-Sept.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The public sector borrowing requirement stood at 538.2 billion escudos in the first nine months of 1996, compared with 602.1 billion in the same year-ago period, the Bank of Portugal said in its latest monthly report.</p>
<p>Revenues from privatisations contributed to this result, the central bank said.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
